<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Finals to close March. Fitting end to a cricket-heavy month.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Tired">>
Raju: I'm tired, Bhai. So many matches.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Confident">>
Ramu: I know—April will be quieter with more time for studies, but finish March properly first.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Their team?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Mix of boys—some you've beaten, some you haven't faced. Standard finals lineup.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Maa said to come back early. She needs help with cleaning.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: We'll finish quick—no long celebrations, no hanging around, just play then home.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Just another match.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Just another match, but play it complete—half-hearted cricket teaches full-hearted bad habits.

